---@field displayName? string Optional. The space's display name. Required when [creating a space](https://developers.google.com/workspace/chat/api/reference/rest/v1/spaces/create) with a `spaceType` of `SPACE`. If you receive the error message `ALREADY_EXISTS` when creating a space or updating the `displayName`, try a different `displayName`. An existing space within the Google Workspace organization might already use this display name. For direct messages, this field might be empty. Supports up to 128 characters.
