---@field requiredWidgets? google_workspace.chat_v1.StringList Optional. Fill this list with the names of widgets that this Action needs for a valid submission. If the widgets listed here don't have a value when this Action is invoked, the form submission is aborted. [Google Workspace add-ons and Chat apps](https://developers.google.com/workspace/extend):
