---@field parameters? google_workspace.chat_v1.GoogleAppsCardV1ActionParameterList List of action parameters.
---@field ["function"]? string A custom function to invoke when the containing element is clicked or otherwise activated. For example usage, see [Read form data](https://developers.google.com/workspace/chat/read-form-data).

